{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2001年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "命主八字日主己土，生于辰月得令，双丙透干，身旺印旺。年支酉金食神与月令辰合金，时支子水偏财被未土穿害，原局喜金水。大运乙卯（1-11岁），七杀强旺，卯木与年支酉金剧烈冲克，七杀攻身且冲克用神食神，主幼年易有意外伤害。2001辛巳流年，天干辛金食神透出，本可制大运乙木七杀，但原局双丙争合辛金，食神被印星合住，制杀无力。地支巳酉半合金局，看似助金，实则巳火为丙火旺根，火旺熔金，食神受伤更重。卯酉冲为金木相战，木主交通、车辆，金主切割、手术，流年引发冲克，应交通意外、手术之象。同时巳火枭印过旺，印主医院、治疗，故为交通意外入院手术。其余选项或与食神被合、印星过旺有关，但卯酉金木冲克为明确意外伤灾信号，与交通手术直接对应。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P2_G2\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 133975, "response_id": "0c13053b-e4c0-4cbe-806b-016a4e3f7360", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 7097, "total_tokens": 7324, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 6822}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 227}}
